{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06564","headline":"昇天行贻卢六健 · 储光羲","name":"昇天行贻卢六健","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"真人居阆风，时奏清商音。\n听者即王母，泠泠和瑟琴。\n坐对三花枝，行随五云阴。\n天长崑仑小，日久蓬莱深。\n上由玉华宫，下视首阳岑。\n神州亦清净，要自有浮沈。\n恻恻苦哉行，呱呱游子吟。\n庐山逢若士，思欲化黄金。\n雨雪没太山，谁能无归心。\n逍遥在云汉，可以来相寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06564.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06564","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}